# Viva Questions

## What is VPC?

A logically isolated virtual network in cloud.

---

## Why use SCP?

To securely transfer files using SSH encryption.

---

## Difference between Public IP and Private IP?

| Public IP                | Private IP            |
| ------------------------ | --------------------- |
| Accessible from internet | Internal network only |

---

## Why use Security Groups?

To control inbound and outbound traffic.

---

## What does chmod 600 mean?

Only owner can read/write file.

